# session-30: a repo-root uploads/ mirror directory (like db/, never
# committed). session-35: ANCHORED to the repo root — the unanchored
# `uploads/` form can match nested route dirs and silently keep them out
# of git. WH-4 (F-1): the upload route family retired (zero consumers);
# the guard STAYS as a belt — any future uploads/ mirror at the root
# still stays out of git.
/uploads/

# session-92: the sweep tool's capture artifacts (regenerated per run)
scripts/sweep-shots/

# session-162: the sweep's cross-process auth state — live session
# material on disk (the combined pair state); follows the db-binary
# discipline: git-ignored, 0600, TTL-bounded. NEVER committed.
scripts/.sweep-auth-state.json
